  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rapid Response Child-Focused Social Cash Transfer and Nutrition Security Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PDO is to reduce the risk of nutrition insecurity of vulnerable populations, in particular children under five in poor rural and urban areas by scaling up the Government Nutrition Enhancement Program and providing cash transfers to vulnerable mothers of children under five.</narrative>
  </description>
